    <string name="help_welcome_title">Welcome to Currency Converter</string>
    <string name="help_body">• Converter: Enter an amount, pick currencies, and see the result instantly. Tap ⇄ to swap.\n\n• Rates: Browse live rates for your base currency. Star favorites to pin them on the dashboard.\n\n• Statistics: See daily change and yesterday’s comparison for major pairs.\n\n• History: Pick any currency pair and time range (1 day to 5 years). Export charts as CSV.\n\n• Rate alerts: Set a target rate and get notified when it is reached.\n\n• Settings: Change language, theme, and favorite currencies. Add the home-screen widget for live rates.\n\nLive rates come from ExchangeRate-API (free). Historical charts use Frankfurter. Data is cached on your device.</string>
